---
import CategoryArchive from '../../components/CategoryArchive.astro';

const articleGroups = [
  {
    label: 'Replacement Parts and Filters',
    subcategories: ['filters'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Covers and Insulation',
    subcategories: ['covers'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Water Testing and Sanitizers',
    subcategories: ['water-testing', 'sanitizers'],
  },
  {
    label: 'Cleaning Tools',
    subcategories: ['cleaning-tools'],
  },
];
---

<CategoryArchive category="buying-guides" showAffiliate={true} articleGroups={articleGroups}>
  <p>
    TubWise buying guides focus on fit, compatibility, safety, and practical selection
    criteria. We do not rank products based on retailer reviews or claim hands-on testing
    unless it actually occurred.
  </p>

  <h2 id="methodology">How these guides are researched</h2>
  <p>
    TubWise uses desk research. We review manufacturer manuals, specifications, labels,
    compatibility information, and official guidance where available. TubWise does not
    independently test products unless an article explicitly says so. Guides explain what
    to compare when choosing a supply, not a universal winner. Specifications,
    availability, and product lines can change, so confirm current details for your spa
    before purchasing.
  </p>

  <h2 id="approach">Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    We prioritize fit, safety, and maintenance practicality. When product links are
    included, they may be affiliate links, disclosed clearly and never presented as the
    only option.
  </p>
</CategoryArchive>
